":"万人が認める可愛らしい容姿であるが、本人は 「可愛い」よりも 「美しい」 と言われたいらしく、やや不満げ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"努力家だが、その姿を他人に見られるのは恥と感じており、高慢な態度で他人に接しがち。元々は世話好きで面倒見のいい一面も持ち、尻に敷いているはずの主人公に指摘されると、照れ隠しに傍若無人発動という日常も垣間見える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"炎系の魔術に関しては超一流で、爆弾的な性格も影響してか、『炎のエルザ』 の異名を持つ。派手な変質系魔法が得意な反面、細かい機微を要求される精密系魔術の類は苦手。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"219200"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21842","sourceWorkId":"13309","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"155 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21842","sourceWorkId":"13309","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"81 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21842","sourceWorkId":"13309","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"54 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21842","sourceWorkId":"13309","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f36c9066e840f07cd1ff7f0a51e55656098fd89c875e843905298bdd3fd03a8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71e60c7ca5527f53625243ba738955ea6dd52413b955a0381e08a1dd6164ed81.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤本教子","creatorId":"vndb:s649","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s649","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s649","name":"平野響子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:222252:219200:5669:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c79554","characterName":"クラリッサ・オールドリッチ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"219202","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"222252"}],"egsCharacterIds":["21843"],"vndbCharacterId":"c79554"},"originalCharacterName":"クラリッサ・オールドリッチ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary